WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.437
Jordan's report arrived. The earlier pictures didn't.

2
00:00:03.477 --> 00:00:06.162
Start as Maya Chen, the administrator.

3
00:00:06.202 --> 00:00:08.580
Click Fill passcode, then Sign in.

4
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.702
Use Sign out when you switch people.

5
00:00:10.947 --> 00:00:13.589
On Patient overview, open Jordan Vale.

6
00:00:13.629 --> 00:00:16.689
Jordan's row shows the latest update and who owns the work.

7
00:00:16.729 --> 00:00:18.549
Casey has a separate chart.

8
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.640
Summary gives you five findings from two visits.

9
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.903
Jordan's ankle X-rays showed swelling.

10
00:00:23.943 --> 00:00:26.331
No new fracture was seen on these views.

11
00:00:26.371 --> 00:00:30.885
The earlier intake also separates Jordan's own history from family history.

12
00:00:31.113 --> 00:00:33.708
Open Ontology and choose Earlier images.

13
00:00:33.748 --> 00:00:35.091
Read from left to right.

14
00:00:35.131 --> 00:00:39.171
The source supports a finding, and the finding links to a staff action.

15
00:00:39.413 --> 00:00:41.165
Click See supporting passage.

16
00:00:41.205 --> 00:00:45.293
The highlighted line asks the receiving nurse to check for the earlier images.

17
00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:47.796
The line above says they were missing at departure.

18
00:00:47.836 --> 00:00:49.389
Click Close to return.

19
00:00:49.613 --> 00:00:53.999
As Maya, open Transfer workspace and click Prepare transfer brief.

20
00:00:54.039 --> 00:00:57.637
Check the nurse's instruction, then click Sign and send to nurse.

21
00:00:57.677 --> 00:01:00.107
Maya has now assigned that check to Riley.

22
00:01:00.347 --> 00:01:04.158
Sign in as Riley Ortiz. Open My inbox and choose Jordan.

23
00:01:04.198 --> 00:01:08.322
For this rehearsal, choose Still pending, then Record image status.

24
00:01:08.362 --> 00:01:11.503
Riley records what the receiving team actually has.

25
00:01:11.747 --> 00:01:13.940
Click Sign and send report to doctor.

26
00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:19.281
Dr. Avery Shah can now read the report alongside Riley's update about the older pictures.

27
00:01:19.513 --> 00:01:22.181
As Avery, open Jordan in My inbox.

28
00:01:22.221 --> 00:01:25.016
Avery needs another doctor to cover this review.

29
00:01:25.056 --> 00:01:28.347
Open Return to administrative staff and enter the reason.

30
00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:30.603
Then click Return handoff to admin.

31
00:01:30.847 --> 00:01:33.742
Back as Maya, open Transfer workspace.

32
00:01:33.782 --> 00:01:37.053
Under New receiving doctor, choose Dr. Morgan Lee.

33
00:01:37.093 --> 00:01:40.399
Click Sign and reassign. Morgan now owns the review.

34
00:01:40.647 --> 00:01:43.256
As Morgan, open Jordan in My inbox.

35
00:01:43.296 --> 00:01:45.698
Click Read signed radiology impression.

36
00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:49.081
That's the radiologist's conclusion in the original report.

37
00:01:49.121 --> 00:01:51.891
Read the highlighted passage, then close it.

38
00:01:52.113 --> 00:01:53.679
Click Sign report review.

39
00:01:53.719 --> 00:01:56.507
The team can now see that Morgan reviewed the report.

40
00:01:56.547 --> 00:01:58.968
Riley's missing-image check stays open.

41
00:01:59.213 --> 00:02:02.379
Return to Riley's inbox and open Jordan's follow-up.

42
00:02:02.419 --> 00:02:07.134
Once the older pictures arrive, choose Arrived and click Save follow-up status.

43
00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.754
Open Glossary for the visual dictionary.

44
00:02:09.794 --> 00:02:11.393
Here's a line for the judges.

45
00:02:11.433 --> 00:02:15.661
We can show what was missing, who checked it, and where the chart says so.

46
00:02:15.913 --> 00:02:19.362
To rehearse again as Maya, open Transfer workspace.

47
00:02:19.402 --> 00:02:21.537
Click Reset and randomize sample.

48
00:02:21.577 --> 00:02:24.804
This restarts Jordan's handoff for all demo accounts.

49
00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:29.685
The study ID changes. Read the new imaging reply before recording its status.
